# Waking the Beast (battlefield.waking_the_beast_cloister_of_flames, CloisterOfFlames, a BattlefieldQuest of OtherAreas.WakingTheBeast, a C# quest; index 2, 30
# minutes, up to 18 players, repeatable, the Rainbow Resonator read by entryRequirement, Fire_Protocrystal the exit). A level 75 Warrior with
# the quest accepted and the resonator. The trigger: the menu 32000. Updates: 0: ignored (option 0); 4 (index 0, not in the menu): REQS_NOT_MET; 32 (index 2, area 0) and 36 (area 4, past
# the zone's arenas): REQS_NOT_MET; 33 (index 2, area 1): registered, entered. The Prime of arena 1 (Ifrit_Prime_WTB) killed: the first
# group's allDeath kills the elementals after it and sets WON; the win (BattlefieldQuest's onBattlefieldWin, accepted):
# battlefieldWin 546 set, 32001; its finish: the battlefield's onEventFinishWin (the framework's), then the quest's 32001
# handler: the eye. After the cleanup, out.
lists CloisterOfFlames/FP_Entrance/onTrigger CloisterOfFlames/onEventUpdate/32000 CloisterOfFlames/onEventFinish/32000 CloisterOfFlames/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=CloisterOfFlames pos=-720.631,-1.4,-597.955 job=WAR lvl=75
quest OtherAreas.WakingTheBeast accepted
keyitem RainbowResonator
login
trigger FP_Entrance                     # the resonator: the menu 32000
update 32000 option=0                   # 0: ignored
update 32000 option=4                   # index 0, not in the menu: REQS_NOT_MET
update 32000 option=32                  # area 0: REQS_NOT_MET
update 32000 option=36                  # area 4: REQS_NOT_MET
update 32000 option=33                  # area 1: registered, entered
finish                                  # in the arena
kill IFRIT_PRIME_ASA-15                # the Prime of arena 1 (allDeath): its elementals die, WON; 32001
finish                                  # the battlefield's finish, then the quest's handler: the eye
tick 11000                              # the won arena's cleanup
tick 10000                              # out of the battlefield
